// Curated overrides of the place names (JMnedict), in inline notation. Add entries with `pnpm dict:override`.
[
  // 中院 is the family name Nakanoin (中院家), not ちゅういん.
  // reported by anonymous 32a3ebbd-37d4-45dc-9332-f025d33bdd96
  "中[なかの]院[いん]",
  // 石神井 is the Tokyo place name Shakujii (石神井公園), not しゃくじん.
  // reported by anonymous 3b190805-873e-4c3b-9b02-d226a2319bfa
  "石[しゃく]神[じ]井[い]",
  // 秋鹿 is the Matsue place name Aika (秋鹿郡, 秋鹿村, 秋鹿町), not あきしか.
  // reported by anonymous 1f2e5c71-da94-456c-88b1-79b8e4da19a7
  // reported by anonymous 269ed72e-a90c-48ad-91b4-24fa353da6a6
  // reported by anonymous 6578e5bc-6be1-4f1f-a4a7-ec9faa1058d5
  "秋[あい]鹿[か]",
  // The Matsue district 秋鹿町 is あいかちょう (the old town of 秋鹿郡 was あいかまち).
  // reported by anonymous c509d1b8-d468-4b03-8367-83f3512a86f9
  "秋[あい]鹿[か]町[ちょう]",
  // 秋鹿郡 is the former Izumo district Aikagun; 郡 alone is left bare, so the run carries it.
  // reported by anonymous 1f2e5c71-da94-456c-88b1-79b8e4da19a7
  "秋[あい]鹿[か]郡[ぐん]",
  // 秋鹿村 is the former Matsue village Aikamura; 村 alone is left bare, so the run carries it.
  // reported by anonymous 269ed72e-a90c-48ad-91b4-24fa353da6a6
  // reported by anonymous 6578e5bc-6be1-4f1f-a4a7-ec9faa1058d5
  "秋[あい]鹿[か]村[むら]",
  // 可愛い is かわいい; the dictionary also holds かあい, and its 可愛 ranks within the prebuilt set.
  "可愛[かわい]",
  // 四天王寺前夕陽ヶ丘 is the Osaka station してんのうじまえゆうひがおか; the run before ヶ is 四天王寺前夕陽.
  // reported by anonymous 7e236e25-fa58-45ff-ba52-415d461aaa04
  "四[し]天[てん]王[のう]寺[じ]前[まえ]夕[ゆう]陽[ひ]",
  // 米津玄師 (the musician) is よねづけんし.
  // reported by anonymous 56d5c45a-3d8c-4403-b66b-0ab3ae9f5423
  "米[よね]津[づ]玄[けん]師[し]"
]
